The Aspirants Skins - Layla "Miss Hikari", Fanny "Blade of Kibou" will return from 9/24 to 10/27!

Event rewards include:
First Draw 10X 50% OFF;
Daily First Draw 50% OFF;
Epic Skin Guaranteed at Each Draw 10X;
Unowned Epic Skin Guaranteed at First Draw 10X.

Here are some ways to get more lottery event Passes!
9/24 - 9/30: Join the Free Aspirants Unite Pass event and pre-register;
10/1 - 10/3 & 10/22 - 10/24: Complete tasks in the game.
